BOSS Roljin Phase 1 Support
    Events
        Time - Every (Random real number between 25.00 and 45.00) seconds of game time
    Conditions
        (Roljin is alive) Equal to True
        (Number of units in RoljinGroup) Less than or equal to 6
    Actions
        -------- Support hostile mobs will appear at random interval from random spawn points --------
        Set VariableSet RoljinSupportInt1 = (Random integer number between 1 and 4)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                RoljinSupportInt1 Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                -------- ============= GROUP 1 =============  --------
                Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Random point in ForestTrollsSpawn01 <gen>)
                Unit - Create 1 Forest Troll for Player 12 (Brown) at VarPoint facing Default building facing degrees
                Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to RoljinGroup
                Set VariableSet RoljinGroup = (Last created unit group)
                Unit - Create 1 Forest Troll for Player 12 (Brown) at VarPoint facing Default building facing degrees
                Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to RoljinGroup
                Unit - Create 1 Forest Troll Trapper for Player 12 (Brown) at VarPoint facing Default building facing degrees
                Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to RoljinGroup
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                -------- attack --------
                Unit Group - Pick every unit in RoljinGroup and do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        Unit - Order (Picked unit) to Right-Click Roljin
                Skip remaining actions
            Else - Actions
